OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with some outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain across Argyll through the day,
OL,7,Fand the odd shower elsewhere this
OL,8,Fmorning. Otherwise Central Belt and
OL,9,Fsouth will be generally dry. Breezy
OL,10,Facross Argyll.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will be a mainly dry
OL,13,Fevening and night with variable
OL,14,Famounts of cloud and clear periods.
OL,15,FOccasional rain across Argyll, more
OL,16,Fespecially later on.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
