OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cloudy day with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain, but drier in the south. Rain
OL,7,Fmay turn heavier and persistent in the
OL,8,Fafternoon across Argyll. Strong
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds along the Argyll
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fon Sunday with outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Fgradually clearing from the north. Dry
OL,15,Fand bright on Monday and Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
